# Branch naming (Thepulimaangani)

1. **Pick a role first:** [trinity-and-native-agents/AGENT_ROLES.md](../trinity-and-native-agents/AGENT_ROLES.md) — the branch name should reflect that role (e.g. `theni`, `pattampoochi`, `thumpi`).
2. **If the environment forces `cursor/…`:** use `cursor/<role>-<short-slug>-ce01` (or the suffix your runner requires), e.g. `cursor/theni-parser-fix-ce01` — **do not** use a generic `cursor/feature-ce01` with no role.
3. **Default integration branch:** `malar` — do not use role branches as the merge target unless the workflow explicitly says so.

Post-merge sync: `./dx/syncagents.sh` (no `PUSH=1` for unattended agents). Human push: `./dx/syncagents-push-human.sh` — [dx/HUMAN_SYNC.md](../dx/HUMAN_SYNC.md).
